  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&apos;s help teens like Mauricio to finish school</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mauricio (23) came to our re-entry school from an alcohol and drug rehabilitation home at the age of 16 without knowing how to read or write. Despite not having the support of his family and living alone, he made it through thanks to the academic, economic and emotional help he received from  Hogar de Cristo. We need your support to replicate Mauricio&apos;s success story and provide an opportunity to hundreds of teens.</narrative>
  </description>
